  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat(cli): Updated System.CommandLine. 2025-06-24\n- feat: Also wrap JSON deserialization exception from error responses. 2025-06-18\n- feat(debug): Now JSON deserialization exceptions will be more clear. 2025-06-18\n- feat: Ignore OpenAPI errors by default. 2025-06-05\n- feat(Source Generators): Added parallel client generation. 2025-06-05\n- feat: Now Enum converter will handle JsonTokenType.Null 2025-05-13\n- feat: Add support for visual studio 2025-05-09\n- feat: Added AnyOfLikeStructure ToString() override. 2025-03-30\n- feat: Added AddMissingPathParameters setting that true by default. 2025-03-30\n- feat: Updated System.Text.Json to 9.0.3 2025-03-21\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: Fixed deprecation warning for AnyOf/OneOf/AllOf types. 2025-06-18\n- fix: Fixed ElevenLabs specific bug. 2025-06-18\n- fix: Fixed deprecated message for generated methods. 2025-06-17\n- fix: Fixed missed serialization of complex query parameters. 2025-06-17\n- fix: Add AutoSDK_Namespace and ClassName metadata 2025-06-05\n- fix: Fixed deepinfra.json issues 2025-05-16\n- fix: Fixed generation if there is file type with binary format. 2025-05-12\n- fix: Fixed issue with invalid default value for big AnyOfs. 2025-05-08\n- fix: Fixed rare issue with conflict types inside AnyOf constructors 2025-05-08\n- fix: Update OpenAPI spec 2025-05-08",
